name dotlessi
category Package
revision 51476
shortdesc Provides dotless i's and j's for use in any math font
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides two commands: \dotlessi and \dotlessj,
longdesc which give access to dotless i's and j's in math mode. They are
longdesc intended for symbols in non English languages.
runfiles size=1
 RELOC/tex/latex/dotlessi/dotlessi.sty
